# Infrastructure Constraints

- No author-operated private infrastructure is required.
- Run one experiment process on one CUDA-capable GPU.
- Checkpoint-based Claims 1-5 support approximately 24 GB of GPU memory with the documented default batches.
- CPU execution is supported by PyTorch but is impractical for the full evaluations.
- Allow approximately 20 GB of free disk space, excluding datasets and downloaded checkpoint archives.
